## Why This Is Asked

This question probes the ability to design scalable, fault-tolerant real-time collaboration systems and reason about ordering, replication, and failure modes.

## Key Concepts

- Durable messaging and exactly-once processing
- Temporal ordering and sequencing
- CRDTs vs operational transformation
- Cross-region replication and rollback

## Code Example

